  "description": "WEHDOE crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P 21 21 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C77 H96 Mn6 N6 O37 Yb3 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn4 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn5 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn6 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.316-3.925 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.24-109.96°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [YbIII3MnIII6(L)6(μ2-OMe)6(OAc)(H2O)2(HOMe)3](NO3)2·6H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies Yb(III), Mn(III).",
